  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "* update go version in dockerfile\n* fix go release yaml\n* update go releaser\n* fix combobox reopen on click\n* Bump golang.org/x/net from 0.55.0 to 0.56.0\n* Bump golang.org/x/term from 0.43.0 to 0.44.0\n* Bump golang.org/x/net from 0.49.0 to 0.55.0\n* fix dark mode for autocomplete\n* feat(webform): add service/method comboboxes with URL and localStorage restore\n* Bump golang.org/x/net from 0.48.0 to 0.49.0\n* Bump github.com/jhump/protoreflect from 1.17.0 to 1.18.0\n* Bump golang.org/x/net from 0.43.0 to 0.47.0\n* Add dark mode implementation via CSS\n* Un-hardcode -plaintext in grpcurl text box. Use the same flags as ui\n* Remove double updateCurlCommand call\n* Bump google.golang.org/protobuf from 1.36.8 to 1.36.10\n* Bump google.golang.org/protobuf from 1.36.7 to 1.36.8\n* Bump google.golang.org/protobuf from 1.36.6 to 1.36.7\n* Bump golang.org/x/net from 0.42.0 to 0.43.0\n* Bump golang.org/x/net from 0.40.0 to 0.42.0\n* Bump golang.org/x/oauth2 from 0.14.0 to 0.27.0 in the go_modules group\n* Bump golang.org/x/net from 0.39.0 to 0.40.0\n* Bump golang.org/x/net from 0.35.0 to 0.38.0\n* Bump google.golang.org/protobuf from 1.36.5 to 1.36.6\n* Bump golang.org/x/net from 0.35.0 to 0.36.0 in the go_modules group\n* Fix filtering services or methods to expose\n* Set GOWORK=off and GOPATHS=-trimpath when building",
